OL,3,GNEWSAReward offered to help solve dog
OL,4,Awalker's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reward of up to #20,000 is being
OL,7,Foffered for information related to the
OL,8,Fmurder of a man whose body was found in
OL,9,Fwoodland.
OL,11,FGraham Pennycook was found dead in
OL,12,Fwoods next to Perham Down polo field in
OL,13,FLudgershall, Wiltshire, on 24 September
OL,14,Fafter he failed to return home from
OL,15,Fwalking his dog that morning.
OL,17,FAn reward is now being offered by
OL,18,Fcharity Crimestoppers, who have asked
OL,19,Fanyone with information to come forward
OL,20,Fanonymously and said "even a small
OL,21,Fdetail" could help.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
