OL,3,GNEWSAReward offered to help solve dog
OL,4,Awalker's murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FWiltshire Police previously urged
OL,7,Fanyone who saw "two men acting
OL,8,Fsuspiciously" between the hours of
OL,9,F10:00 BST and 11:00 on the morning of
OL,10,Fhis disappearance to get in touch with
OL,11,Fthem.
